---
import { site } from "../config";
---

<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="wrap about__grid">
    <figure>
      <img
        src="/images/about-desk.jpg"
        alt="A quiet evening desk with a lamp, notes, glasses, and a laptop."
        width="1280"
        height="720"
      />
    </figure>
    <div class="copy">
      <p class="kicker"><span class="kicker__dot"></span>About</p>
      <h2 class="display">Built from a real pain, not a trend.</h2>
      <p>
        The person who made EyesRhythm spent two decades as a software
        developer. Long days in front of screens added up. After years of that
        work, the eyes were dry, red, and often in real pain.
      </p>
      <p>
        With newer tools, it became possible to build a small companion that
        stays on this computer. He has been using it himself for the last two
        months, and the change has been clear enough to share.
      </p>
      <p>
        The aim is simple: technology that is small, useful, and aimed at a
        real problem — healthy blink rhythm during screen work — without
        another loud app in the way.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you try it, we would be glad for honest feedback. That is how this
        mission stays reliable, and quiet.
      </p>
      <button class="btn btn--primary" type="button" data-open-purchase>
        {site.cta}
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    padding: clamp(64px, 9vw, 120px) 0;
    background: var(--band);
  }

  .about__grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 40px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  figure {
    margin: 0;
  }

  img {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 28px;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .copy {
    display: grid;
    gap: 14px;
    justify-items: start;
  }

  .display {
    font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4vw, 3rem);
  }

  .copy p {
    color: var(--text-soft);
    max-width: 38rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .about__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 0.95fr 1.05fr;
      gap: 56px;
    }
  }
</style>
